  <div class="about-cols">
    <section aria-labelledby="story-title">
      <h2 id="story-title">My story</h2>
      <p>I'm a photographer and artist based in Auburn, Maine. What draws me to photography is emotion: a laugh, a quiet glance, a dog mid-grin, the sky going dark at totality. I photograph animals, the people I love and the moments in between, and I'm happy to wait as long as it takes for a feeling to show itself.</p>
      <p>Beyond the camera, I make digital illustrations, relief carvings and logos. Different tools, same goal: making something that makes you feel something.</p>

      <h2>A few favorites</h2>
      <ul class="about-favs">
        {%- for f in favorites %}
        <li><a href="{{ f.url }}"><span class="thumb">{% decorativePicture f.file, "(min-width: 56rem) 14rem, 33vw", "lazy", [500] %}</span><span class="cap">{{ f.title }}</span></a></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="facts-title">
      <h2 id="facts-title">Quick facts</h2>
      <ul class="about-facts">
        <li><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 9l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 11v5c3 2 9 2 12 0v-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Education</b><span class="small">University of Maine, Orono, 2018. Studio art and art education; minors in graphic design and art history.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5L7.5 21 12 18.5 16.5 21 15 13.5"/></svg></span><span><b>Award</b><span class="small">2017 Juried Student Art Exhibition, Lord Hall Gallery, for <a href="/photography/light-columns/">Light columns</a>.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 20l4-1L19 8l-3-3L5 16z"/><path d="M14 7l3 3"/></svg></span><span><b>Design</b><span class="small">Logos for <a href="/projects/windham-parks-and-recreation/">Windham Parks &amp; Recreation</a> (in use 2016–2025) and <a href="/projects/eric-s-miniatures/">Eric's Miniatures</a>.</span></span></li>
